    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d438">

                <pb facs="1505" n="1347" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1347"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Collier</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-06-29"><hi rendition="#italic">June 29,
                        1906</hi>.</date></dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 55.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    No. 109, of the 8th instant, reporting concerning the festivities attending the
                    wedding of His Majesty the King.</p>
                <p>You will make suitable expression of this Government’s thanks for the courtesies
                    paid to the special ambassador and suite, and express appreciation of the
                    consideration shown by Señor Don Jaime de Ojeda, who acted as aid and escort to
                    the ambassador.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Elihu Root</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
